{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "regret_lookahead_density_v2",
  "intent": "Building on parent #17, this variant adds a small cluster_density bonus (0.06*cd) to prefer candidates surrounded by many other unvisited cities, which tend to produce better TSP continuations by reducing future travel. The regret weight is reshaped to (0.12 + 0.30*p^1.5) for marginally stronger late-tour emphasis, and the lookahead coefficient is slightly reduced (0.05→0.04) to keep distance dominant. These changes target improved tiebreaking on uniform and grid instances while preserving the parent's strong clustered performance.",
  "tags": [
    "cluster",
    "nonlinear"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    d = f['distance']\n    rd = f['return_distance']\n    nr = f['nearest_remaining']\n    r = f['regret']\n    p = f['progress']\n    cd = f['cluster_density']\n    s = -d + 0.04 * nr / (d + 0.1 + 1e-9) + (0.12 + 0.30 * (p ** 1.5)) * r + 0.30 * rd * (1 + 0.5 * p) + 0.06 * cd\n    return s",
